{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>亞太區主要股市上升。</p><p></p><p>日本股市扭轉兩日跌勢，曾升百分之2，升上65,000點水平。</p><p></p><p>韓國股市一度急升逾百分之4，收市升幅收窄至約百分之3。兩大權重股SK海力士及三星電子回升約半成。</p><p></p><p>台灣股市終止兩連跌，曾升百分之2。澳洲股市企穩8,800點水平。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T09:21:08.916017+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T09:57:44.456903+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:17:41.608172+00:00","content_hash":"8950a1a9521f749afefa847d7df29569c64a47c83847637f61d32fcabfb86b47","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}